[1994.890089, "o", "\r\u001b[29d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[29;16H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[29;61H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[106G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[30;16H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[61G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[106G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy"]
[1994.890224, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Facilitator setup: publishing the Academy template\r\u001b[4d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThis folder is the \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**Academy template repository**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m referred to throughout the\r\u001b[5d"]
[1994.890433, "o", "ALP documents (\"create the pair repository from the Academy template\"). Publish\r\u001b[6dit once on the academy's GitHub organisation before 21 August 2026, and every\r\u001b[7dpair copies it to start their project.\r\u001b[9d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## One-time publish (about ten minutes)\r\u001b[11d\u001b[35m1. \u001b[32m**Create a new repository**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m on the academy's GitHub organisation, named\u001b[12;4Hsomething like \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`cyber-sentinel-y2-template`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m. Make it \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**public**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m (the project\u001b[13;4Hrelies on free unlimited GitHub Actions, which requires public repos).\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m2. \u001b[32m**Upload these files.**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Easiest by keyboard: on the new empty repo's page,\u001b[16;4Hchoose \"uploading an existing file\", then drag this whole folder's contents\u001b[17;4Hin, or from a terminal:\u001b[18;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m```\r\u001b[19d   git init\r\u001b[20d   git add -A\r\u001b[21d   git commit -m \"Academy template: initial structure, dev container, starter pipeline\"\r\u001b[22d   git branch -M main\r\u001b[23d   git remote add origin https://github.com/\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[36m<org>\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m/cyber-sentinel-y2-template.git\r\u001b[24d   git push -u origin main\r\u001b[25d   ```\r\u001b[27d\u001b[35m3. \u001b[32m**Mark it as a template.**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m In the repository's Settings, tick\r\u001b[2d\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
